{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><div class=\"contentTxt\"><p>【Now新聞台】外國領導人陸續抵埗深圳，習近平亦會見其他出席APEC領導人非正式會議的外國領袖，包括巴布亞新幾內亞總理馬拉佩等。</p></div>\n<div class=\"contentTxt\"><p>而同樣出席會議的多國領袖陸續抵埗，包括越南國家主席蘇林、智利總統卡斯特等，這次亦是他今年3月就任以來，首次訪華。</p></div>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T04:48:19.365002+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"Now 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T04:07:36+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T04:41:50.023895+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T04:41:50.023895+00:00","content_hash":"19f3267c9e94361e2f187927e5b355d5d1707c5418eb6d60c676d3f41815c97e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}